PARITY unit scope reproduced (every region of the web source + its imported tab components)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Header     : title, subtitle, data-freshness chip (ADR-013 staleness), range picker.
  Hero (6)   : distance · drives · energy · efficiency · gas savings · CO₂ saved.
  Tabs (4)   : Overview / Driving / Charging / Battery (TSTabs).
  Overview   : distance-by-vehicle bar; fleet-usage donut; efficiency leaderboard; per-vehicle radar;
               energy & activity bars; day-of-week composed; monthly-cost composed; quick links.
  Driving    : 6 perf cards; speed/trip-distance/duration distributions; hourly composed; temp-vs-eff
               scatter; daily-trend composed; efficiency-trend area; 6 temperature stat cards.
  Charging   : 6 summary cards; charger-types donut; start-battery bars; hourly composed; charger-brands
               leaderboard; monthly-trend composed; 4 cost-analysis cards; cost-by-type bars.
  Battery    : 5 health cards; health-timeline area; capacity + range line trends; degradation & cycles
               composed; whole-tab no-trend empty.
  States     : loading (.redacted skeleton) · empty (ContentUnavailableView) · error (Retry) — page-level
               AND each section's own empty state. Charts: P3 Swift Charts wrappers
               (TSBarChart/TSLineChart/TSAreaChart/TSPieChart/TSScatterChart/TSRadarChart) + one
               feature-local native Swift Charts composition for the multi-geometry ComposedCharts. No WKWebView.
  Units      : every physical quantity stored SI; converted at the SwiftUI render boundary via the shared
               Units (KMP) facade — efficiency Wh·km⁻¹ → Wh·mi⁻¹, m→km/mi, m·s⁻¹→speed, °C→pref, Wh→kWh.
  i18n/a11y  : every visible literal from Localizable.xcstrings (web key names); accessibility labels/traits
               on cards, charts, leaderboard rows, freshness chip; Dynamic Type; light/dark + tokens only.

